data: {"id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1079", "run_id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**\n   - `aiops-case-v08/workload` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，`Ready=False`，`Restart Count=18`。\n   - Phase=Running（Pod 对象存活），但容器反复终止。\n\n2. **终止原因与 Exit Code**\n   - `Last State.Terminated.Reason = Error`，`Exit Code = 127`。\n   - `State.Waiting.Reason = CrashLoopBackOff`，Events 中大量 `Back-off restarting failed container`。\n\n3. **日志证据**\n   - Elasticsearch 返回的 6 条日志全部为：`sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`。\n   - 表明容器内 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 二进制/脚本不存在。\n\n4. *", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789135856051, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f", "seq": 1080, "ts_ms": 1789135862697, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 539.815, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v08", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "ff949fdb84268aff73f0fec6996e3c0869153c345c6f221459a3159fc95cc5cb", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "4182c485795822f1f0df2844c509a674a4c1aa8b540a855009f840f25d7261c4"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f", "seq": 1081, "ts_ms": 1789135862697, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f", "seq": 1082, "ts_ms": 1789135872597, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.9, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1780, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | 容器镜像中缺少入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning  BackOff  2m41s (x303 over 67m)  kubelet  Back-off restarting failed container app` | 确认 Pod 处于长期反复重启状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `CrashLoopBackOff` | 确认当前异常组状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: `127` | 确定进程退出的具体错误码 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: `Error` | 确认容器非正常终止的原因类型 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` | 直接揭示命令未找到及执行方式（sh -c exec） |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=CrashLoopBackOff, value=1) | 验证 K8s State 中的等待原因 |\n| 7 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (value=17) | 验证异常的持续性和频率 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 的 `Event` 和 `State` 事实确认了 Pod 处于由 `CrashLoopBackOff` 和 `Error` 导致的重启循环中。Logging 维度中明确的 `not found` 错误原文及 `127` 退出码，在因果链上闭环，解释了为何 `CrashLoopBackOff` 机制会被反复触发。Metrics 提供了 K8s 状态的独立交叉验证，未发现冲突证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n已验证的上游原因 → 失败机制 → 直接失败 → 用户可见现象\n容器镜像中缺失入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` → 容器启动时执行 `sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command` 失败，shell 返回 Exit Code 127 → 容器因命令未找到异常终止（Reason=Error），kubelet 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启机制 → Pod 持续处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是**容器镜像中缺少入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command`**。\n\n该文件缺失导致容器启动命令执行失败（Evidence: Logging fact-3d6f1ba89f0f, K8s fact-02f34fd06295），容器以 Exit Code 127 退出，进而触发 kubelet 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 重试机制（Evidence: K8s fact-3ba583563c90, fact-a3803b720c20）。现有证据链完整，足以支撑上述结论。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | 容器镜像中缺少入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning  BackOff  2m41s (x303 over 67m)  kubelet  Back-off restarting failed container app` | 确认 Pod 处于长期反复重启状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `CrashLoopBackOff` | 确认当前异常组状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: `127` | 确定进程退出的具体错误码 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: `Error` | 确认容器非正常终止的原因类型 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` | 直接揭示命令未找到及执行方式（sh -c exec） |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=CrashLoopBackOff, value=1) | 验证 K8s State 中的等待原因 |\n| 7 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (value=17) | 验证异常的持续性和频率 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 的 `Event` 和 `State` 事实确认了 Pod 处于由 `CrashLoopBackOff` 和 `Error` 导致的重启循环中。Logging 维度中明确的 `not found` 错误原文及 `127` 退出码，在因果链上闭环，解释了为何 `CrashLoopBackOff` 机制会被反复触发。Metrics 提供了 K8s 状态的独立交叉验证，未发现冲突证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n已验证的上游原因 → 失败机制 → 直接失败 → 用户可见现象\n容器镜像中缺失入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` → 容器启动时执行 `sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command` 失败，shell 返回 Exit Code 127 → 容器因命令未找到异常终止（Reason=Error），kubelet 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启机制 → Pod 持续处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是**容器镜像中缺少入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command`**。\n\n该文件缺失导致容器启动命令执行失败（Evidence: Logging fact-3d6f1ba89f0f, K8s fact-02f34fd06295），容器以 Exit Code 127 退出，进而触发 kubelet 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 重试机制（Evidence: K8s fact-3ba583563c90, fact-a3803b720c20）。现有证据链完整，足以支撑上述结论。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

