data: {"id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f-final", "run_id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f", "seq": 1084, "ts_ms": 1789135872609, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | 容器镜像中缺少入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning  BackOff  2m41s (x303 over 67m)  kubelet  Back-off restarting failed container app` | 确认 Pod 处于长期反复重启状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `CrashLoopBackOff` | 确认当前异常组状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: `127` | 确定进程退出的具体错误码 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: `Error` | 确认容器非正常终止的原因类型 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` | 直接揭示命令未找到及执行方式（sh -c exec） |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=CrashLoopBackOff, value=1) | 验证 K8s State 中的等待原因 |\n| 7 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (value=17) | 验证异常的持续性和频率 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 的 `Event` 和 `State` 事实确认了 Pod 处于由 `CrashLoopBackOff` 和 `Error` 导致的重启循环中。Logging 维度中明确的 `not found` 错误原文及 `127` 退出码，在因果链上闭环，解释了为何 `CrashLoopBackOff` 机制会被反复触发。Metrics 提供了 K8s 状态的独立交叉验证，未发现冲突证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n已验证的上游原因 → 失败机制 → 直接失败 → 用户可见现象\n容器镜像中缺失入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` → 容器启动时执行 `sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command` 失败，shell 返回 Exit Code 127 → 容器因命令未找到异常终止（Reason=Error），kubelet 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启机制 → Pod 持续处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是**容器镜像中缺少入口命令文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command`**。\n\n该文件缺失导致容器启动命令执行失败（Evidence: Logging fact-3d6f1ba89f0f, K8s fact-02f34fd06295），容器以 Exit Code 127 退出，进而触发 kubelet 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 重试机制（Evidence: K8s fact-3ba583563c90, fact-a3803b720c20）。现有证据链完整，足以支撑上述结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 539.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v08/workload: 539.8s (Evidence 533.2s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v08/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 573.555, "metrics": {"run_id": "c4bed7b1c1cd4f1f", "mttr": {"value": "9.6m", "seconds": 573.5613791942596, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 573561.3791942596, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 571040.4374599457, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5373.263597488403, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2166.3694381713867}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 23823.75144958496, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 539814.9378299713, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9900.004625320435, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

